# E429-draft — 知识图谱草稿（draft:true，未入索引）
# 格式规则: key: value（冒号后一个空格）；多行值续行以空格开头；
# 列表逗号分隔；正则 | 分隔；# 注释行；空行忽略。
# 对应人类文档: 同目录 E429-draft-CL9E.md

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
id:                     E429
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|clang++|make|test_package
phase: configuration|testing
error_signature: use of undeclared identifier 'the_log'|LOG_[A-Z]+ unqualified|silent success exit 0|All .* selected tests passed

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity: 2
category: headers, testing, conan
match_keywords: short-name macro, unqualified expansion, using namespace, lest silent success, -p pass flag, test_package consumer
title: Header-only C++03 short-name macros expand to unqualified library-namespace symbols; silent-success test runners need an explicit pass flag for evidence

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: clue-style libraries define short LOG_* macros whose bodies reference helper names (e.g. the_log()) WITHOUT namespace qualification; the names resolve only when the consumer TU imports the library namespace the way upstream test TUs do. Qualified-macro spelling clue::LOG_INFO(x) is invalid because the macro is preprocessed before qualification. Additionally old lest_cpp03 builds print nothing on success (summary guarded by failures>0 or output.pass()), so a passing default run yields exit 0 with zero countable evidence.
affected_scope: Header-only C++03-era libraries shipping short-name function-like macros and pre-2015 lest-based suites
verification_cmd: conan create with upstream tests in build(); conan test for consumer; -p run for counts

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: consumer-namespace-import-plus-pass-flag-evidence
rec_description: Write test_package sources mirroring the upstream test TU preamble (using namespace <lib>;) instead of qualifying macro calls; keep the upstream Makefile invocation as the blocking gate (failures do print) and collect numeric evidence from a separate run with the runner's pass-reporting flag (clue/lest_cpp03: ./test_clue -p).
rec_command: make -j2 -C tests && (cd tests && ./test_clue -p)
rec_auto_fix:           false                       # 引擎不可自动执行（消费者源码写法问题）

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

# ★ 禁止策略 (与推荐方案同等重要) ★
# forbid_N_pattern:     正则(|分隔), 匹配则拒绝/警告
# forbid_N_reason:      为什么禁止
# forbid_N_consequence: 违反后的后果
forbid_1_pattern: clue::LOG_[A-Z]+\(|treating silent exit-0 as evidence
forbid_1_reason: Macro names are not namespace members; qualification breaks preprocessing, and a silent passing run provides no assertion counts for MANIFEST/PR evidence.
forbid_1_consequence: G2 test_package compile failure or unevidenced case counts rejected at review.
# forbid_2_pattern:
# forbid_2_reason:
# forbid_2_consequence:

